---
import FieldGuideLayout from '../../../components/FieldGuideLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<FieldGuideLayout
  title="Konami RESO extensions"
  description="Non-Nintendo RESO type tags Konami uses: tad (widget table), nib (per-container blob), sfo (nested RESO), szl (nested LZ11)."
  crumbs={[
    { label: 'Field Guide', href: `${base}/field-guide/` },
    { label: 'File Formats', href: `${base}/field-guide/file-formats/` },
    { label: 'Konami extensions' },
  ]}
>
  <p>
    Four RESO <code>type_tag</code> values sit outside the standard Nitro set.
    All appear only in variant-0 (16-byte TOC entry) RESO containers.
  </p>

  <h2>Tag census</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>type_tag</th><th>Reads as</th><th>Description</th><th>Occurrences</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>szl</code></td><td><code>lzs</code></td><td>Nested LZ11-compressed sub-RESO</td><td>34,464</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>tad</code></td><td><code>dat</code></td><td>Widget placement table</td><td>694</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>sfo</code></td><td><code>ofs</code></td><td>Nested uncompressed RESO</td><td>333</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>nib</code></td><td><code>bin</code></td><td>Per-container blob (variable schema)</td><td>251</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2><code>tad</code> — widget placement table</h2>
  <p>
    Static table of UI widget records used by overlay-driven 2D screens. Found
    in shop/menu containers (<code>2d/buyitem.lzs</code>,
    <code>2d/defcos.lzs</code>, etc.).
  </p>
  <p>
    The <code>buyitem.lzs</code> <code>tad</code> blob holds 76 records,
    each 28 bytes = 26 bytes data + 2-byte <code>FF FF</code> terminator
    (per <code>notes/phaseA_ghidra/DISCOVERIES.md</code>). The richer layout
    for screen-control records (used by the 12-byte sprite-place tables that
    live inside the overlay code at <code>0x0215A538</code>, see
    <a href={`${base}/field-guide/how-the-game-works/sprite-pipeline/`}>sprite pipeline</a>)
    is 12 bytes:
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Offset</th><th>Size</th><th>Type</th><th>Field</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>+0x00</code></td><td>2</td><td><code>u16</code></td><td>cell_id (which NCER cell to draw)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x02</code></td><td>2</td><td><code>u16</code></td><td>palette / style bank</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x04</code></td><td>2</td><td><code>u16</code></td><td>sub_index (secondary index for compound widgets)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x06</code></td><td>2</td><td><code>u16</code></td><td>flags</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x08</code></td><td>2</td><td><code>u16</code></td><td>screen_x (0..256)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x0A</code></td><td>2</td><td><code>u16</code></td><td>screen_y (0..192)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Example: buyitem screen widget table at <code>0x0215A538</code></h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>#</th><th>cell</th><th>pal</th><th>sub</th><th>flags</th><th>X</th><th>Y</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>0</td><td>6</td><td>9</td><td>21</td><td>0</td><td>10</td><td>92</td><td>Left-side icon</td></tr>
      <tr><td>1</td><td>6</td><td>9</td><td>21</td><td>0</td><td>220</td><td>92</td><td>Right-side icon</td></tr>
      <tr><td>2</td><td>7</td><td>9</td><td>22</td><td>0</td><td>128</td><td>107</td><td>Center icon</td></tr>
      <tr><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>9</td><td>18</td><td>0</td><td>125</td><td>100</td><td>Center near-button</td></tr>
      <tr><td>4</td><td>4</td><td>12</td><td>19</td><td>24</td><td>128</td><td>96</td><td>Main center</td></tr>
      <tr><td>5</td><td>5</td><td>13</td><td>20</td><td>25</td><td>128</td><td>96</td><td>Main center alt</td></tr>
      <tr><td>6</td><td>0</td><td>10</td><td>15</td><td>0</td><td>128</td><td>96</td><td>BG center</td></tr>
      <tr><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>14</td><td>23</td><td>27</td><td>128</td><td>96</td><td>Effect center</td></tr>
      <tr><td>8</td><td>1</td><td>10</td><td>16</td><td>0</td><td>128</td><td>96</td><td>UI alt 1</td></tr>
      <tr><td>9</td><td>2</td><td>11</td><td>17</td><td>0</td><td>128</td><td>96</td><td>UI alt 2</td></tr>
      <tr><td>10</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>Zero terminator</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2><code>nib</code> — per-container binary</h2>
  <p>
    No single schema — each container's <code>nib</code> payload uses its own
    layout. Notable instances:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>global.lzs#33</code>, <code>#36</code>, <code>#37</code> — system tables</li>
    <li><code>2d/designcloth.lzs#206..207</code> — 256-byte recipe blobs for
      designer-cloth slots</li>
  </ul>

  <h2><code>sfo</code> — nested uncompressed RESO</h2>
  <p>
    The payload is itself a full RESO container with its own 16-byte header.
    Parse recursively.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>global.lzs#34, #51</code> — sub-RESOs containing fonts / metadata</li>
    <li><code>2d/scrollbar.ofs#0</code> — nested chrome assets</li>
    <li>6 RESO containers in the corpus are "nested-sfo" (mostly chrome)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2><code>szl</code> — nested LZ11 sub-blob</h2>
  <p>
    Payload is an LZ11 stream with no LZS wrapper. Decompress with
    <code>decompress_lz11()</code> (skip the wrapper-strip step). After
    decompression the bytes are typically another RESO container.
  </p>
  <p>
    Example: <code>title_pack.ofs</code> has 5 <code>szl</code> entries, each
    decompressing to an ~80–90 KB inner RESO holding two 256×192 8bpp BG
    screens (top + bottom of the title for one season-of-day variant).
  </p>

  <h2>Container shapes</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Count</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Only empty TOC entries (placeholders)</td><td>1,477</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Non-UI script / message / text</td><td>348</td></tr>
      <tr><td>3D-only (tbsn / mbsn / cbsn)</td><td>186</td></tr>
      <tr><td>NCER-bearing, no static recipe (code-driven)</td><td>123</td></tr>
      <tr><td>LZS-wrapped atlases</td><td>123</td></tr>
      <tr><td>NCER-bearing + recipe: 37 rnan-only, 8 tad, 5 nib</td><td>50</td></tr>
      <tr><td>NCER-less (BG-only) containers</td><td>30</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Nested-sfo containers</td><td>6</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Source</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>notes/all_sections/01_full_survey.txt</code> — full type_tag histogram</li>
    <li><code>notes/phaseA_ghidra/BUYITEM_RECIPE_CRACKED.md</code> — widget table decode</li>
    <li><code>notes/phaseA_ghidra/DISCOVERIES.md</code> — Konami quirks index</li>
  </ul>
</FieldGuideLayout>
